# The reviewed formal statements. A change here needs the owner's review and a
# matching update of formal/STATEMENTS.lock, which CI checks. The lock also
# covers every project module that formal/Spec.lean imports, transitively, and
# formal/Proofs/AxiomAudit.lean, so a change to one of those fails CI until the
# owner approves a lock update.
/formal/SPEC.md @soispoke
/formal/Spec.lean @soispoke
/formal/Spec/ @soispoke
/formal/STATEMENTS.lock @soispoke

# What enforces the lock, the audit and the build.
/.github/ @soispoke
/formal/tools/check_formal.py @soispoke
/formal/Proofs/AxiomAudit.lean @soispoke
/formal/lakefile.toml @soispoke
/formal/lean-toolchain @soispoke
/formal/lake-manifest.json @soispoke
